config APP_FOTA_CHECK_INTERVAL_MINUTES
	int "Periodic FOTA check interval in minutes (0 = only boot + fota_update command)"
	default 0
	help
	  How often the device polls Memfault for a new firmware release, on top
	  of the check at boot and on an MQTT "fota_update" command. 0 disables
	  periodic checks. A non-zero value is a safety net so a remote device can
	  always pick up a recovery build even if MQTT is wedged.
